      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "함께 길을 걷는데, 유달리 뚫어지게 올려다보는 안나의 시선이 느껴졌다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "一緒に歩いていると、私のことをじっと見上げるアンナの視線を感じた。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "안나?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "どうしたの？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "단장님.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "団長。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "혹시 다른 옷은 없으세요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "もしかして、他の服はお持ちじゃないんですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "내 옷 말이야?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "服…？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "네! 볼 때마다 항상 그 옷이라서요",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "はい！いつもその服なので、お聞きしてみました。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그렇다고 옷에 체취가 깊게 밴 것 같지도 않고…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "でも、服に体臭が染みついてる感じもないし…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "혹시 옷장 안에 같은 옷만 여러 벌 있으신가… 하는 걱정이 든다고 할까!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "クローゼットに同じ服が何着も並んでるんじゃ…ってちょっと心配になっちゃいました！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "…걱정이 들 정도야?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "…心配する程のことかな？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그게 말이죠, 여정 단장도 타운가드랑 닮은 부분이 있다고 생각해요.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "それがですね！旅の団長も、タウンガードと似ているところがあると思うんです。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "사람들에게 신뢰감 뿐만 아니라 친근감도 줄 수 있어야 하죠.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "人から信頼されることも大事ですが、親しみやすい印象も必要ですから。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "깔끔하게 입는 건 필수지만, 거기에 귀여운 포인트도 있으면 좋다! 는 느낌?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "清潔感は必須だけど、そこに可愛いポイントがあれば最高！って感じなんです。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "네 깃털 장식 같은 거?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "アンナの羽飾りみたいに？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 22,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE_LOOP",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "역시 단장님! 눈썰미가 좋으셔!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "さすが団長！見る目がありますねー！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 23,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "말 나온 김인데, 이거 귀엽지 않아요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ちなみに、これとかどうですか？可愛くないですか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 24,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_3",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "안나는 생글생글 웃으며 수갑을 내 눈 앞에서 흔들었다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "アンナはニコニコ笑いながら、手錠を目の前で振ってみせた。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 25,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "수갑에 달린 검은 고리깃털이 팔랑거렸다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "手錠に付いた黒い羽飾りが、ひらひらと揺れている。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 26,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "오해를 살 행동은 자제해줘…",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "誤解を招くような行動はやめてほしいな…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 27,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_OFFICER_POLICE_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_OFFICER_POLICE",
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_6",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "하여튼! 그래서 말인데요, 단장님의 코트랑 옷은…",
